# Files stow must not link, using stow's own mechanism (stow(8), "Ignore Lists").
#
# Zotero rewrites both at runtime, so a symlink is replaced by a real file on
# the next launch. They live here to seed a fresh profile and are installed by
# zotero.stow.sh with `cp --remove-destination`, not by stow.
prefs\.js
treePrefs\.json
